//! Verified serialization injectivity for canonical byte encodings.
//!
//! Proves that canonical byte encodings are injective: equal byte
//! sequences imply equal input values. Composes with collision-resistance
//! axioms from `chain.rs` and `snapshot_integrity.rs` to give the full
//! guarantee: same hash → same structure.
